{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Horde Hunters",
    "steam_appid": 2178560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horde Hunters is an adrenaline pumping horde survival game  that pushes you to  become an unstoppable force to defeat the hordes of hell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How it plays?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a character, fight against hordes of enemies in various maps, collect loot, level up your character, upgrade your weapons and survive long enough to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178560/extras/1967add1d3c35e4d5d5b5f993c7f8129.avif?t=1749811817\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features and content list</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 characters</strong> each with a unique weapon and ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>75+ weapons and items</strong> to create your character build and synergies with. Weapons fire automatically however you have the option to manually aim your primary weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ consumables</strong> (instant single-use items) can be picked up and used when needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 maps</strong> with typically short runs (~15-20min). 6 endless maps with global leaderboards and a custom weekly map to compete in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10+ buildings</strong> you can interact with on the map.  Various missions, events and changing weather keep you busy and on your toes. Procedural maps make every run unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 party members</strong> can be hired to aid you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>25 runes</strong> that can alter the way you play your next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40+ power-ups</strong> to permanently boost your run (meta progression)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessible</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom difficulty options are available if you find the game too easy or hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game speed can be increased if you want more fast-paced runs</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horde Hunters is an adrenaline pumping horde survival game  that pushes you to  become an unstoppable force to defeat the hordes of hell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How it plays?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a character, fight against hordes of enemies in various maps, collect loot, level up your character, upgrade your weapons and survive long enough to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178560/extras/1967add1d3c35e4d5d5b5f993c7f8129.avif?t=1749811817\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features and content list</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 characters</strong> each with a unique weapon and ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>75+ weapons and items</strong> to create your character build and synergies with. Weapons fire automatically however you have the option to manually aim your primary weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20+ consumables</strong> (instant single-use items) can be picked up and used when needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 maps</strong> with typically short runs (~15-20min). 6 endless maps with global leaderboards and a custom weekly map to compete in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10+ buildings</strong> you can interact with on the map.  Various missions, events and changing weather keep you busy and on your toes. Procedural maps make every run unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 party members</strong> can be hired to aid you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>25 runes</strong> that can alter the way you play your next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40+ power-ups</strong> to permanently boost your run (meta progression)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessible</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom difficulty options are available if you find the game too easy or hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game speed can be increased if you want more fast-paced runs</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slay hordes of enemies on thrilling missions to save the humanity from a looming demon onslaught.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe fact that even though I've recently played a bunch of survivors games yet still found myself addicted to Horde Hunters pretty much says everything you need to know about the game\u201d<br>- That Video Game Life<br><br>\u201cThis is how you make a game in a popular series and you one up it\u201d<br>- Dad's Gaming Addiction<br><br>\u201cThis hurts me to say it - I think I actually prefer it to Vampire Survivors and I have sunk an ungodly amount of time into Vampire Survivors\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Pure Play TV<br>",
